WEBVTT

00:00:43.022 --> 00:00:46.276
This world is...

00:01:10.008 --> 00:01:16.598
The path you take extends far in the distance

00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:19.934
The wind's on our side, let's go

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:26.733
The answers we seek won't be easy to find,

00:01:26.941 --> 00:01:31.404
But we knew that before we set out

00:01:32.655 --> 00:01:40.663
The footprints in our dreams
never lead in a straight path

00:01:40.872 --> 00:01:45.918
Adding as we go, our world map keeps growing

00:01:46.127 --> 00:01:48.671
Resonate, song of the wind

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.718
Even with closed eyes,
our hearts push us forward

00:01:53.926 --> 00:01:59.432
The clouds we aim for are further, higher

00:01:59.641 --> 00:02:02.185
Reach out, song of the wind

00:02:02.393 --> 00:02:07.273
Listen carefully and hear the voice
of our hearts bellowing

00:02:07.482 --> 00:02:12.445
Shine like a brilliant light

00:02:12.654 --> 00:02:16.199
You, become a blue melody

00:02:29.045 --> 00:02:29.420
Sunrise...?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.421
"Chapter 1 - Capital of Seraphim"
Sunrise...?

00:02:30.421 --> 00:02:33.299
"Chapter 1 - Capital of Seraphim"

00:02:44.644 --> 00:02:47.397
A hero brandishing the Sacred Blade...

00:02:47.605 --> 00:02:49.565
It's a mural of the Shepherd!

00:03:11.546 --> 00:03:13.506
"The Legend of the Shepherd.

00:03:13.715 --> 00:03:20.847
It was the Capital of Seraphim,
a sacred place higher than the highest peaks.

00:03:21.055 --> 00:03:27.687
Its gates, tightly closed, only open
to those who will lead the world of man.

00:03:27.895 --> 00:03:32.275
The Shepherd, accompanied by Seraphim,
arrives on the earth.

00:03:32.483 --> 00:03:35.319
The Shepherd, wielding
the might of the Seraphim,

00:03:35.528 --> 00:03:39.365
cleanses the world of darkness,
to bring salvation."

00:03:42.577 --> 00:03:46.539
It's just folklore... The world is already...

00:05:03.157 --> 00:05:04.450
Is that...?

00:05:41.112 --> 00:05:43.239
Wh-What is...?

00:06:06.304 --> 00:06:10.099
Is this another ruin of Asgard?

00:06:35.374 --> 00:06:36.876
Is this...

00:06:39.045 --> 00:06:42.965
...the Mark of the Shepherd?

00:06:43.174 --> 00:06:46.969
The place the holy symbol shines...

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:32.306
The Mark of the Shepherd opens the path...

00:07:32.515 --> 00:07:34.642
So the legends are true...?

00:08:26.068 --> 00:08:30.448
Wow! Such a great ruin, here?

00:08:30.656 --> 00:08:31.741
Sorey!

00:08:33.868 --> 00:08:34.785
Mikleo!

00:08:34.994 --> 00:08:38.956
Why are you venturing out on your own again?

00:08:39.165 --> 00:08:41.917
You need to be more careful.
You're just a normal human.

00:08:42.126 --> 00:08:44.086
If you fall, it won't end well for you.

00:08:47.048 --> 00:08:50.217
| guess it's thanks to that, though...

00:08:54.722 --> 00:08:56.390
It's great, huh?

00:08:57.391 --> 00:08:58.893
Yeah!

00:09:01.896 --> 00:09:06.025
That said, I'm sure the elders
know about that ruin.

00:09:06.233 --> 00:09:09.111
Yeah, I guess so.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:13.908
They all know we really love exploring ruins.

00:09:14.116 --> 00:09:15.576
Therefore...

00:09:17.161 --> 00:09:19.121
Sorey?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.457
| found it!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.046
What did you find?

00:09:27.254 --> 00:09:29.298
Check this out.

00:09:37.223 --> 00:09:40.101
| see, an illusion by Gramps.

00:09:41.185 --> 00:09:42.937
Good eye.

00:09:44.355 --> 00:09:45.940
So, what do we do?

00:09:46.148 --> 00:09:48.651
We explore, of course!

00:09:48.859 --> 00:09:51.028
No.

00:09:51.237 --> 00:09:52.988
Gramps?!

00:09:53.197 --> 00:09:55.241
Why not, sir?

00:09:55.449 --> 00:10:03.332
That area was sealed off long ago.
You may not approach.

00:10:03.541 --> 00:10:07.628
No exploration, no investigation. Understood?

00:10:16.387 --> 00:10:20.766
| wonder why Gramps doesn't
want us to enter that ruin.

00:10:20.975 --> 00:10:25.020
Look, Mikleo. Here's the chapter of arrival.

00:10:25.229 --> 00:10:29.024
"Long ago, in the age of the gods,
darkness shrouded over the world.

00:10:29.233 --> 00:10:33.404
The Seraphim arrived
and brought light back to the world.

00:10:33.612 --> 00:10:39.660
The Seraphim separated, to live in various
areas of the world, to support all existence.

00:10:39.869 --> 00:10:43.372
One of these is the Capital of Seraphim."

00:10:43.581 --> 00:10:48.210
Sorey, are you saying that the ruin
we saw today was the Capital of Seraphim?

00:10:48.419 --> 00:10:49.503
Yeah.

00:10:52.923 --> 00:10:56.302
The people of the Capital of Seraphim
began to provide worship.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:01.182
Amongst those, the ones with talent
were allowed to speak with the Seraphim.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.350
Humans and Seraphim...

00:11:03.559 --> 00:11:09.773
The Seraphim blessed the people,
and the people offered the Seraphim prayer.

00:11:09.982 --> 00:11:13.861
The ones with talent became the bridge
to connect the people with the Seraphim

00:11:14.069 --> 00:11:17.281
at the Capital of Seraphim.

00:11:19.074 --> 00:11:20.784
Interesting.

00:11:24.121 --> 00:11:28.626
The Celestial Record.
You really like that book.

00:11:28.834 --> 00:11:33.923
Of course. And given
the description in this book,

00:11:34.131 --> 00:11:37.760
| think there is a high chance that
ruin is the Capital of Seraphim.

00:11:37.968 --> 00:11:40.262
So you're still going to go?

00:11:40.471 --> 00:11:41.889
And you?

00:11:42.097 --> 00:11:46.518
Well, of course... There is one other thing.

00:11:46.727 --> 00:11:52.524
Didn't you notice? The ruin was
outside Gramps' area of protection.

00:11:52.733 --> 00:11:54.235
Now that you mention it...

00:11:54.443 --> 00:11:57.363
We really have to check it out.

00:11:57.571 --> 00:12:00.574
Are you sure you want to disobey Gramps?

00:12:00.783 --> 00:12:03.410
What, now you're not going?

00:12:05.329 --> 00:12:08.499
| guess, whoever finds
something awesome first...

00:12:08.707 --> 00:12:10.084
It's a race then.

00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:11.377
Yeah.

00:13:58.317 --> 00:13:59.985
| knew it!

00:14:03.781 --> 00:14:08.619
A hero brandishing the Sacred Blade!
It's a mural of the Shepherd!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.538
I---

00:14:18.754 --> 00:14:21.256
Is this...

00:14:21.465 --> 00:14:23.884
...the Mark of the Shepherd?

00:14:24.093 --> 00:14:25.803
Hey!

00:14:26.011 --> 00:14:28.972
What is it, Mikleo?

00:14:29.181 --> 00:14:31.642
You beat me, this time.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.894
Not just this time.

00:14:34.103 --> 00:14:35.646
This time.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.409
This lightning... It's not natural...!

00:15:07.845 --> 00:15:09.179
Master Zenrus.

00:15:09.388 --> 00:15:12.474
Kyme. I am aware.

00:15:12.683 --> 00:15:17.354
There are fools causing a scene outside my area.

00:15:17.563 --> 00:15:20.774
Yes. What shall we do?

00:15:20.983 --> 00:15:24.194
Sorey and Mikleo, have they returned?

00:15:24.403 --> 00:15:25.404
No.

00:15:29.867 --> 00:15:32.244
Those two...

00:15:32.453 --> 00:15:38.208
| suppose the secrets of those that came
before them pique their attention, but...

00:15:38.417 --> 00:15:41.837
Kyme, I will remain here for now.

00:15:42.045 --> 00:15:43.130
Understood.

00:15:52.931 --> 00:15:55.267
Is this... a temple?

00:16:04.401 --> 00:16:05.819
A dead end...

00:16:34.515 --> 00:16:40.479
If they come into my area,
they will face my wrath.

00:16:42.481 --> 00:16:46.443
It's almost like the ruin
is calling on the lightning!

00:16:52.699 --> 00:16:53.784
Sorey?!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.999
Let's get out of here.

00:17:21.228 --> 00:17:24.856
Surging currents! Twin Flow!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.903
What? Wait, wait!

00:17:34.116 --> 00:17:36.493
--Sorey!
--Ouch...

00:17:38.203 --> 00:17:39.746
That was close.

00:17:43.041 --> 00:17:45.502
More ruins, underground?

00:17:45.711 --> 00:17:48.046
Good thing we fell down here!

00:17:48.255 --> 00:17:53.176
Whatever. But let's try
to find a way out of here.

00:17:53.385 --> 00:17:54.469
Yeah.

00:17:59.099 --> 00:18:01.393
Wow, what a drop!

00:18:01.602 --> 00:18:03.562
That one earlier was pretty close.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.356
There were murals and stuff.
You have to prioritize.

00:18:06.565 --> 00:18:08.609
Right. Whatever.

00:18:11.903 --> 00:18:12.946
Someone's there.

00:18:13.155 --> 00:18:14.740
Here?

00:18:16.325 --> 00:18:18.035
Hey, Mikleo...

00:18:19.786 --> 00:18:22.831
It's a human.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.917
A human? Here? How?

00:18:26.126 --> 00:18:27.252
We have to go!

00:18:27.461 --> 00:18:29.963
Gramps told you.

00:18:30.172 --> 00:18:32.507
You need to stay away from humans.

00:18:32.716 --> 00:18:36.428
| can't just leave her!
She might still be alive!

00:18:39.723 --> 00:18:41.600
Fine. I'll give what help I can.

00:18:41.808 --> 00:18:43.268
Mikleo!

00:18:44.227 --> 00:18:46.146
But how do we get across to...

00:18:53.612 --> 00:18:54.988
No way...

00:18:55.197 --> 00:18:56.823
Yes indeed!

00:18:58.116 --> 00:18:59.618
Let's go!

00:19:06.833 --> 00:19:08.377
You fool...

00:19:08.585 --> 00:19:11.254
Coming down here won't get us closer to...

00:19:11.463 --> 00:19:13.924
Mikleo, look.

00:19:19.012 --> 00:19:21.014
| see...

00:19:27.312 --> 00:19:30.023
A transparent bridge. Good eye.

00:19:35.445 --> 00:19:36.488
Let's hurry.

00:19:36.697 --> 00:19:38.240
Oh, right.

00:19:39.449 --> 00:19:41.410
How was this made?

00:19:41.618 --> 00:19:44.705
It couldn't have been with human technology.

00:19:46.415 --> 00:19:50.001
So it's at least as old as the Age of Mythology?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.753
| don't know.

00:20:03.765 --> 00:20:05.767
We really should rethink this.

00:20:07.227 --> 00:20:08.562
Sorey!

00:20:09.646 --> 00:20:12.232
Hey... Are you okay?

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.324
Huh?

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.705
...The lightning...

00:20:29.708 --> 00:20:34.337
Good, she looks okay. Can you stand?

00:20:41.678 --> 00:20:45.974
Thank you. I'm sorry to have troubled you.

00:20:46.183 --> 00:20:47.559
You are...?

00:20:47.768 --> 00:20:50.604
I'm Sorey. Nice to meet you!

00:20:50.812 --> 00:20:52.314
Sorey...

00:20:58.111 --> 00:21:00.155
Sorey...

00:21:00.363 --> 00:21:02.449
Are you the Shepherd?

00:21:14.711 --> 00:21:19.716
If right now [ close my eyes,

00:21:21.426 --> 00:21:28.016
I'm on a journey with no return

00:21:28.225 --> 00:21:40.028
When a brief lull comes,
we sleep embracing our desires

00:21:40.237 --> 00:21:47.369
And what we see in our dreams
lights up our world

00:21:47.577 --> 00:21:54.626
It's in this budding passion
that we find our hope

00:21:54.835 --> 00:22:02.467
Let's rest our wings for tomorrow

00:22:02.676 --> 00:22:08.139
We're only able to laugh like we are,

00:22:08.348 --> 00:22:14.104
Because at the end of our journey,

00:22:14.312 --> 00:22:21.236
It will surely be ours--
a sense we've done our duty

00:22:21.444 --> 00:22:32.163
So let's envision our future and sleep

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:39.087
Let's all go together

00:22:41.089 --> 00:22:44.718
"Next episode preview"

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:48.305
Mikleo, I'm going to try
talking to her some more.

00:22:48.513 --> 00:22:51.057
It's important for men to maintain a cleanly
appearance. Did you bathe yesterday?

00:22:51.266 --> 00:22:51.641
| did.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:53.226
--Hair?
--Washed.

00:22:53.435 --> 00:22:54.686
--Teeth?
--Brushed!

00:22:54.895 --> 00:22:56.104
--Handkerchief?
--Got it!

00:22:56.313 --> 00:22:57.689
--The weather today?
--Fine!

00:22:57.898 --> 00:22:59.733
Go talk to her.

00:23:03.069 --> 00:23:08.992
No... I don't know how to start.
Mikleo, do you know how to talk to girls?

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:13.622
Gramps taught me. Men must keep it cool.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.206
--Show me an example.
--Okay.

00:23:15.415 --> 00:23:16.374
I'll play the girl.

00:23:16.583 --> 00:23:17.792
Yeah.

00:23:18.001 --> 00:23:20.879
It's warm today.

00:23:21.087 --> 00:23:22.839
| ignore.

00:23:23.048 --> 00:23:25.717
What is your favorite food?

00:23:25.926 --> 00:23:26.593
| ignore.

00:23:26.801 --> 00:23:28.970
How is this supposed
to help me get close to her?!

00:23:29.179 --> 00:23:32.974
Gramps told me this is
the cool way to address humans!

00:23:33.183 --> 00:23:35.393
Next week, "Elysia." Look forward to it!

00:23:35.602 --> 00:23:38.146
Sorey, make sure to practice until next week.

00:23:38.355 --> 00:23:39.522
Okay...
